No credible evidence supports the claim; authoritative sources including a [U.S. Senate report](https://www.hsgac.senate.gov/wp-content/uploads/imo/media/doc/221208_HSGACMajorityReport_Covid-19.pdf) and U.S. Intelligence Community assessment found no indication of a pre-planned pandemic or that the virus was engineered and released intentionally. Bill Gates' documented activities, such as funding pandemic preparedness exercises like [Event 201](https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/factcheck/2020/03/26/fact-check-bill-gates-backed-pandemic-exercise-didnt-predict-covid-19/5081854002/) and [pledging funds for outbreak response](https://www.cnn.com/2020/02/06/business/bill-melinda-gates-foundation-novel-coronavirus/index.html), are consistent with long-standing philanthropy and public health advocacy, not orchestrating a pandemic, as confirmed by multiple [independent fact-checks](https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/factcheck/2020/08/25/fact-check-plandemic-sequel-makes-false-claims-bill-gates/5627223002/).